    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i was also wondering about heart rate. if they're using sensors in the seat or the armrests, is there a way to mask my pulse or rhythm so the data looks normal or just flat? like, is there a specific way to sit or something i can wear to muffle that signal?",
